# Context7

When changing code that depends on Next.js, React, Zod, Playwright, Tailwind, Vitest, etc.:

1. Fetch current docs via **Context7 MCP** before inventing APIs.
2. Domain/product truth stays in `docs/` — Context7 is library truth only.
3. If Context7 is disconnected, say so and use official docs — do not invent.
